WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
Who is the handsome guy standing with Song Xiahua?

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,600
She looks so considerate to him

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:07,880
Do I want Keke to see me at a glance?

4
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:14,350
You seem to be closer to Miko than you are to me. Are you jealous? Don’t worry.

5
00:00:14,670 --> 00:00:16,510
Your position in my heart is different

6
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:18,630
After all, we made it all the way from the orphanage

7
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:20,870
You are the most trustworthy person in my heart

8
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:25,790
Among the clients I have recently worked with are well-known directors who will recommend you after your foot injury is healed.

9
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:29,430
Is it true that you can try a brighter and smaller role to practice your skills?

10
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:30,830
You are the best to me

11
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:32,590
I will become a big star in the future

12
00:00:32,710 --> 00:00:34,030
You are my exclusive lawyer

13
00:00:34,150 --> 00:00:35,550
Let's meet at the top together

14
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:37,230
Wait until you enter the entertainment industry

15
00:00:37,710 --> 00:00:39,430
There will be more choices by then

16
00:00:39,750 --> 00:00:42,510
What I want is not a lawyer who pays a single legal fee.

17
00:00:42,830 --> 00:00:45,150
But a high-ranking person who can pay millions at will

18
00:00:49,430 --> 00:00:50,470
Haven't seen you all night

19
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:51,550
do you miss me
